    <section class="rise-fall" id="timeline" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
      <h2 class="profile-section-title" id="timeline-title">Timeline</h2>
      <ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">552</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bumin-qaghan">Bumin</a> founds the Turkic Khaganate, the first state to bear the name Türk</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 720</span><span class="rf-text">The adviser <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tonyukuk">Tonyukuk</a> sets up the first of the great Old Turkic inscriptions in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mongolia">Mongolia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">732</span><span class="rf-text">The memorial inscription of Kul Tigin is raised in the Orkhon valley</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">762–763</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uyghurs">Uyghur</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khagan">khagan</a> adopts <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manichaeism">Manichaeism</a>, whose texts are translated into Old Turkic</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">840</span><span class="rf-text">The fall of the Uyghur Khaganate drives the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uyghurs">Uyghurs</a> to the oases of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turfan">Turfan</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gansu">Gansu</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1069</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yusuf-balasaguni">Yusuf Khass Hajib</a> completes the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kutadgu-bilig">Kutadgu Bilig</a>, the first great Islamic work in Turkic</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1070s</span><span class="rf-text">Mahmud al-Kashgari writes his <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/diwan-lughat-al-turk">Compendium of the Languages of the Turks</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baghdad">Baghdad</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1893</span><span class="rf-text">Vilhelm Thomsen deciphers the Old Turkic runic script</span></li></ol>
